  "post_content": "<p>Este domingo ha finalizado el Mercat de Nadal, que se ha ido desarrollando durante el fin de semana en la plaza de Espa&ntilde;a de Onda, en un ambiente muy fr&iacute;o.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/12/IMG_8812.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Quiz&aacute;s por ello, durante la ma&ntilde;ana de domingo y mientras actuaba la coral Veus de Lled&oacute;, en la caseta del restaurante Las Piscinas estaban cocinando una buena paella.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadaldiumenge/img_8811.jpg\" alt=\"img_8811\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadaldiumenge/img_8812.jpg\" alt=\"img_8812\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadaldiumenge/img_8813.jpg\" alt=\"img_8813\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadaldiumenge/img_8814.jpg\" alt=\"img_8814\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadaldiumenge/img_8815.jpg\" alt=\"img_8815\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadaldiumenge/img_8816.jpg\" alt=\"img_8816\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadaldiumenge/img_8817.jpg\" alt=\"img_8817\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadaldiumenge/img_8818.jpg\" alt=\"img_8818\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatnadaldiumenge/img_8819.jpg\" alt=\"img_8819\" style=\"max-width:100%;h